{"id":"n24589-1-2","stage":3,"title":"조르다 · 纠缠","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n24589-1-2-1","ko":"주말에 가족들하고 뭐하고 지내셨어요?","zh":"周末您和家人一起做了什么呀？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"주말에","meaning":"周末","explanation":"주말：周末；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"주말","audio":"/audio/dc80d0fe247835379f4f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"19548","senseId":"1","lemma":"주말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"주말에","audio":"/audio/ff068f34f21f5a2dea38.mp3"}},{"text":"가족들하고","meaning":"家庭，家人","explanation":"가족：家庭，家人；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象；하고：连接共同参与或比较的对象，常表示“和、与”；结合句中动作理解。","readings":[{"term":"가족","audio":"/audio/7659575fd72a872b8d05.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44487","senseId":"1","lemma":"가족","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가족들하고","audio":"/audio/8efd246007fd28f9bba5.mp3"}},{"text":"뭐하고","meaning":"什么，怎么回事；做，干","explanation":"뭐：什么，怎么回事；하다：做，干；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"뭐","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3"},{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84991","senseId":"3","lemma":"뭐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"뭐하고","audio":"/audio/95aae8fac0c7c799ea4c.mp3"}},{"text":"지내셨어요?","meaning":"度过","explanation":"지내다：度过；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"지내다","audio":"/audio/d56e2e0e23cd1763208c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17173","senseId":"4","lemma":"지내다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"지내셨어요","audio":"/audio/cdbfa312db68f470a0b2.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"dc80d0fe24783537","term":"주말","zh":"周末","audio":"/audio/dc80d0fe247835379f4f.mp3","entryId":"19548","definition":"一周的尽头。","pronunciation":["주말"]},{"id":"7659575fd72a872b","term":"가족","zh":"家庭，家人","audio":"/audio/7659575fd72a872b8d05.mp3","entryId":"44487","definition":"主要指聚在一起生活，由婚姻、父母、子女、兄弟等的关系构成的社会单位；或指其成员。","pronunciation":["가족"]},{"id":"95b5c8cf1b249b7a","term":"뭐","zh":"什么，怎么回事","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3","entryId":"84991","definition":"对于已经发生的意外事件或状况，强调自己的惊讶、后悔、遗憾的话。","pronunciation":["뭐ː"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行某种行动、动作或活动。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"d56e2e0e23cd1763","term":"지내다","zh":"度过","audio":"/audio/d56e2e0e23cd1763208c.mp3","entryId":"17173","definition":"经过一定的时间。","pronunciation":["지ː내다"]}],"audio":"/audio/b7ebce0866af599365f4.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n24589-1-2-2","ko":"지수가 하도 놀러 가자고 졸라서 놀이공원에 다녀왔어.","zh":"因为智秀一直缠着要一起去玩，所以我们去了游乐园。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"지수가","meaning":"智秀","explanation":"지수：智秀；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"지수가","audio":"/audio/979e8723b1f704e0856a.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"지수가","audio":"/audio/979e8723b1f704e0856a.mp3"}},{"text":"하도","meaning":"过于，太","explanation":"하도：过于，太。","readings":[{"term":"하도","audio":"/audio/a69330a0e09b93c8f165.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84302","senseId":"1","lemma":"하도","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하도","audio":"/audio/a69330a0e09b93c8f165.mp3"}},{"text":"놀러","meaning":"玩耍，玩乐","explanation":"놀다：玩耍，玩乐；러：用于移动动词前，表示移动的目的：“去/来做……”。","readings":[{"term":"놀다","audio":"/audio/8fc8305f6371680eeeca.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"88353","senseId":"1","lemma":"놀다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"놀러","audio":"/audio/56ad7f4b97efb1434426.mp3"}},{"text":"가자고","meaning":"去","explanation":"가다：去；자고：转述一起行动的提议：“提议、说一起……”。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"14","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가자고","audio":"/audio/95eafe67f1a65b620d67.mp3"}},{"text":"졸라서","meaning":"纠缠，缠磨，央求","explanation":"조르다：纠缠，缠磨，央求；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"조르다","audio":"/audio/3aba5691ed5a523ca94e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"24589","senseId":"1","lemma":"조르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"졸라서","audio":"/audio/9abc2ffc2937f81b52d9.mp3"}},{"text":"놀이공원에","meaning":"游乐园，游乐场","explanation":"놀이공원：游乐园，游乐场；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"놀이공원","audio":"/audio/c665e4a5f02e31f2eacc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"90233","senseId":"1","lemma":"놀이공원","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"놀이공원에","audio":"/audio/425b4f060d074b410694.mp3"}},{"text":"다녀왔어.","meaning":"去一趟，去了趟","explanation":"다녀오다：去一趟，去了趟；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"다녀오다","audio":"/audio/09b8a3cf21a41c7a72ed.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64529","senseId":"1","lemma":"다녀오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"다녀왔어","audio":"/audio/b0db3334f4b23c7c80c3.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"a69330a0e09b93c8","term":"하도","zh":"过于，太","audio":"/audio/a69330a0e09b93c8f165.mp3","entryId":"84302","definition":"(强调)非常过分或特别大地。","pronunciation":["하도"]},{"id":"8fc8305f6371680e","term":"놀다","zh":"玩耍，玩乐","audio":"/audio/8fc8305f6371680eeeca.mp3","entryId":"88353","definition":"玩着游戏等度过有趣、愉快的时光。","pronunciation":["놀ː다"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"去","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"为做某事而向别的地方移动。","pronunciation":["가다"]},{"id":"3aba5691ed5a523c","term":"조르다","zh":"纠缠，缠磨，央求","audio":"/audio/3aba5691ed5a523ca94e.mp3","entryId":"24589","definition":"一直缠着某人做什么事情。","pronunciation":["조르다"]},{"id":"c665e4a5f02e31f2","term":"놀이공원","zh":"游乐园，游乐场","audio":"/audio/c665e4a5f02e31f2eacc.mp3","entryId":"90233","definition":"拥有各种供人们观看或乘坐游玩的设施及娱乐器材的地方。","pronunciation":["노리공원"]},{"id":"09b8a3cf21a41c7a","term":"다녀오다","zh":"去一趟，去了趟","audio":"/audio/09b8a3cf21a41c7a72ed.mp3","entryId":"64529","definition":"去某地后又回来。","pronu